            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### A box behind your text

Text you add to a screenshot can now sit on a box, so it stays readable over
a busy photo where no text colour works. Pick it from the new menu beside the
text size: black, white or a few colours, or **Custom…** for any colour at any
opacity, including a see-through one that still shows the picture underneath.
The words stay exactly where you put them; the box appears around them.
]]></description>
